Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: veltos-base
Architecture: all
Depends: base-files (>= 13), ${misc:Depends}
Description: VeltOS base system identity
 Identifies the system as VeltOS, a Debian-based desktop distribution, by
 providing /usr/lib/os-release. The Debian file is kept as a dpkg
 diversion (/usr/lib/os-release.debian) and restored when this package is
 removed.
 .
 VERSION_CODENAME stays at the Debian codename so that third-party
 repositories which key off it (Steam, NVIDIA, WineHQ) keep working.
